// Exact Q5_K gate/up contraction with local F32 SwiGLU.
//
// One workgroup owns 128 tokens by 128 FFN channels. Sixteen wave32
// subgroups contract both projections while sharing the F32 activation load
// and its transient F16 WMMA tile. Q5_K weights remain in their canonical
// GGUF encoding and both projections accumulate in F32. The x128 schedule
// rounds the final SwiGLU value once to the F16 operand type consumed by the
// following Q6_K down projection instead of rerounding it in every output tile.

